() Tj T*
(1. Immediate batch recall assessment for MOR-2026-089.) Tj T*
(2. Root cause investigation with findings shared within 30 days.) Tj T*
(3. Corrective and Preventive Action \(CAPA\) plan.) Tj T*
(4. Replacement stock from a different batch.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Retained samples are available for collection at your earliest convenience.) Tj T*
